<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">THE TWILIGHT ZONE · 伊森利恩部落</view>
  <view class="title">欢迎回到 TTZ。</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="muted">正在检查登录状态…</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:elif="{{user}}">
    <view class="section-title">{{user.name}}</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{!user.profileComplete}}">请先在“我的”中补充微信名和 TTZ 群昵称。</view>
    <view class="error" wx:elif="{{user.approvalStatus === 'REJECTED'}}">审核未通过：{{user.rejectReason || '请修改资料后重新提交。'}}</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:elif="{{!user.isApproved}}">成员资料已提交，正在等待管理员审核。</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:else>已通过成员审核，可以查看活动并参与报名。</view>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="scanLogin">扫描网页二维码</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:else>
    <view class="section-title">建立微信身份</view>
    <view class="muted">首次使用会建立 TTZ 自有登录态，不会保存或返回微信 session_key。</view>
    <button wx:if="{{!profileStepOpen}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="openProfileStep">微信登录</button>
    <view wx:if="{{profileStepOpen}}" class="profile-consent">
      <view class="section-title">完善微信资料</view>
      <view class="muted">选择头像并填写微信名称后继续。资料只用于公会成员识别，可暂时跳过，之后在“我的”中补充。</view>
      <button class="avatar-picker" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar">
        <image wx:if="{{avatarPath}}" class="consent-avatar" src="{{avatarPath}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view wx:else class="consent-avatar avatar-placeholder">+</view>
        <text>{{avatarPath ? '更换头像' : '选择微信头像'}}</text>
      </button>
      <input class="nickname-input" type="nickname" value="{{wxNickname}}" bindinput="onNicknameInput" placeholder="填写微信名称" />
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="login">确认资料并登录</button>
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="skipProfileAndLogin">暂不授权，继续登录</button>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{localDevAuthEnabled}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="localDevLogin">本地开发管理员登录</button>
    <view wx:if="{{localDevAuthEnabled}}" class="muted">仅适用于微信开发者工具连接本机 API。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
</view>
